# Trained CellTypist models: 24M of pickles, regenerable from the cached Census references.
# The per-model .json metadata IS kept -- it records the organ, the panel, how many of the
# panel genes the reference carried, the label granularity and the solver, which is the
# provenance a reader needs and the pickle does not provide.
celltype_models/*.pkl
